title:
  "Naseza: A Large-Scale Dataset for Persian Hate Speech and Offensive Language
  Detection"
abstract: |
  Naseza is a large-scale dataset of Persian text curated for hate speech and
  offensive language detection tasks. It combines multiple social media sources
  to provide a rich and diverse resource for Persian NLP research.
